WEBVTT

00:00:01.326 --> 00:00:03.328
Lord Yatterman…

00:00:03.328 --> 00:00:06.331
Because of me, you lost
an underwater power plant

00:00:06.331 --> 00:00:08.917
and couldn’t secure the land for your factory.

00:00:08.917 --> 00:00:11.002
I also let Doronjo and her gang get away.

00:00:11.002 --> 00:00:12.921
Yes, sir! I know.

00:00:12.921 --> 00:00:15.507
I cannot afford another failure!

00:00:16.841 --> 00:00:20.553
You’re at the end of your rope,
aren’t you, General Goro?

00:00:20.553 --> 00:00:23.181
You can be replaced easily, you know.

00:00:23.181 --> 00:00:25.683
Struggle as best as you can.

00:00:27.352 --> 00:00:30.021
Damn you, Doronjo… Damn you, Doronbow!

00:00:30.021 --> 00:00:33.316
You really made me go all out this time.

00:00:33.316 --> 00:00:38.530
I, General Goro, will put my heart
and soul into punishing you!

00:00:38.530 --> 00:00:42.242
This is my last chance!

00:01:00.500 --> 00:01:04.960
Absent-minded, I only prayed to the stars

00:01:04.960 --> 00:01:10.760
Losing sight of all that was precious

00:01:11.180 --> 00:01:15.600
Absent-minded, I kept my eyes fixed on the same spot

00:01:15.600 --> 00:01:21.310
And came to a standstill myself

00:01:23.230 --> 00:01:26.480
We don't need no reasons

00:01:28.610 --> 00:01:31.570
To change for the better

00:01:31.910 --> 00:01:38.870
Now, let's dream to the extreme

00:01:38.870 --> 00:01:40.960
You're a shooting star

00:01:40.960 --> 00:01:44.250
Kick open the doors that stand in your way

00:01:44.250 --> 00:01:49.470
And leap beyond the infinite horizon

00:01:49.470 --> 00:01:51.550
Light on the shooting star

00:01:51.550 --> 00:01:57.560
Don't look back; what you seek is in front of you

00:01:57.560 --> 00:02:00.680
Let's go in search of it

00:02:00.680 --> 00:02:05.440
Fly away

00:02:22.775 --> 00:02:25.570
Now, come and enjoy our performance!

00:02:25.570 --> 00:02:29.157
But the door to the adult materials
that you shouldn’t be looking at…

00:02:29.157 --> 00:02:32.160
…doesn’t open although it
appears as if it’s about to open.

00:02:32.160 --> 00:02:35.371
This is a risqué performance.

00:02:37.373 --> 00:02:39.000
What’re you doing?

00:02:39.000 --> 00:02:43.505
There’s no way you can earn money
like this. Right, Honorable Oda?

00:02:53.014 --> 00:02:54.807
What a wonderful performance!

00:02:54.807 --> 00:02:56.476
I’ve never seen anything like this!

00:02:56.476 --> 00:02:57.977
Show us more!

00:02:57.977 --> 00:03:00.688
What?! Seriously?!

00:03:00.688 --> 00:03:04.692
Tonzra! We’ve conducted many
kinds of business in the past,

00:03:04.692 --> 00:03:07.695
but we’ve never seen
our customers this pleased!

00:03:07.695 --> 00:03:12.700
Boyayan, we finally did it!
Our time has finally come!

00:03:12.700 --> 00:03:15.537
Thank you very much!
Thank you very much!

00:03:15.537 --> 00:03:17.830
Dance with us!

00:03:17.830 --> 00:03:20.333
Let’s receive the applause together!

00:03:20.333 --> 00:03:21.793
Wh-What?!

00:03:21.793 --> 00:03:24.212
Now, please come here!

00:03:26.881 --> 00:03:29.384
L-Like this?

00:03:29.384 --> 00:03:32.303
How cute!

00:03:32.303 --> 00:03:34.222
I'm

00:03:34.222 --> 00:03:36.516
…cute…?

00:03:36.516 --> 00:03:39.727
We want to see more!

00:03:39.727 --> 00:03:42.564
Come now! Take it easy and enjoy our show!

00:03:42.564 --> 00:03:47.068
This is a risqué performance!

00:03:47.068 --> 00:03:49.862
I’ll splay my legs apart, oink!

00:03:49.862 --> 00:03:53.074
All right! Show us more!

00:03:53.074 --> 00:03:54.826
Okay!

00:03:54.826 --> 00:03:57.912
And…

00:03:57.912 --> 00:04:01.082
Capture!

00:04:01.082 --> 00:04:02.208
Huh?

00:04:02.208 --> 00:04:03.668
Capture?!

00:04:03.668 --> 00:04:04.919
Oink?

00:04:07.171 --> 00:04:09.340
Yatter!

00:04:09.340 --> 00:04:11.384
Y-Yatter soldiers?!

00:04:11.384 --> 00:04:12.427
Shoot!

00:04:12.427 --> 00:04:14.512
It was a trap!

00:04:14.512 --> 00:04:16.848
Capture them!

00:04:21.477 --> 00:04:23.896
Let us go! Let us go!

00:04:23.896 --> 00:04:27.025
To think that they applauded us
so that we’d let our guard down…

00:04:27.025 --> 00:04:29.277
Once again, what a splendid trap!

00:04:29.277 --> 00:04:34.782
Even though they’re our enemy,
I must say that was brilliant. I can’t move.

00:04:34.782 --> 00:04:37.827
You’ve caused me a lot of trouble.

00:04:37.827 --> 00:04:39.287
Goro!

00:04:39.287 --> 00:04:44.959
This whole town was a trap to capture you!

00:04:44.959 --> 00:04:47.337
Bring in Yatterelephant Paddy Wagon!

00:04:47.337 --> 00:04:49.380
Yatterman!

00:04:49.380 --> 00:04:53.426
I’ll clear my name and redeem my honor.

00:04:55.303 --> 00:04:59.599
Where’s that Galina kid
and that strange girl?

00:05:08.941 --> 00:05:11.069
Okay, it’s done!

00:05:13.404 --> 00:05:14.489
There!

00:05:15.531 --> 00:05:18.826
OW… This is pretty hard.

00:05:18.826 --> 00:05:20.870
Rolling… Rolling…

00:05:20.870 --> 00:05:23.498
It’s noisy… Rolling…

00:05:31.547 --> 00:05:33.299
Doronjo!

00:05:34.467 --> 00:05:35.802
Gatchan?

00:05:35.802 --> 00:05:38.346
Shh! Come this way.

00:05:38.346 --> 00:05:40.181
Let go of me!

00:05:40.181 --> 00:05:43.518
Don’t touch me!

00:05:43.518 --> 00:05:46.020
What’re you gonna do with us?!

00:05:46.020 --> 00:05:47.855
Shut up already!

00:05:50.483 --> 00:05:52.902
I’ll tell you.

00:05:52.902 --> 00:05:57.407
You are revolting against Lord Yatterman.

00:05:57.407 --> 00:06:00.493
Hence, you’ll be sent to Abareshi Prison!

00:06:00.493 --> 00:06:03.413
Abareshi Prison?!

00:06:03.413 --> 00:06:05.456
What’s that?

00:06:05.456 --> 00:06:10.712
Once you’re in Abareshi Prison,
you’ll never be able to get out.

00:06:10.712 --> 00:06:13.047
Be prepared!

00:06:21.264 --> 00:06:25.518
Units Three and Four!
Go find that Galina kid and Al--

00:06:28.563 --> 00:06:31.274
That’s "Alouette," General Goro.

00:06:32.525 --> 00:06:34.944
Find and capture those two!

00:06:34.944 --> 00:06:38.865
Yatterman!

00:06:38.865 --> 00:06:42.326
Let’s go. To Abareshi Prison!

00:06:42.326 --> 00:06:44.120
Yatterman!

00:06:48.374 --> 00:06:50.334
I’ll make sure with all my might to make them

00:06:50.334 --> 00:06:55.673
regret trying to bring down
our great Lord Yatterman!

00:07:03.765 --> 00:07:08.478
He said once they’re in there,
they can’t get out… Wh-What should I do?

00:07:08.478 --> 00:07:11.105
What happened to Doronjo?

00:07:11.105 --> 00:07:13.983
Uh… Uhm…

00:07:17.695 --> 00:07:19.113
Ally, this way.

00:07:40.301 --> 00:07:42.053
This is…

00:07:51.312 --> 00:07:54.273
It’s rusted but looks like it still works!

00:07:54.273 --> 00:07:56.609
Ally, let’s use this to flee.

00:08:04.325 --> 00:08:06.244
A chimpanzee?!

00:08:09.372 --> 00:08:12.083
Ally, step back! It’s dangerous!

00:08:12.083 --> 00:08:15.795
You don’t want us to touch the car?

00:08:15.795 --> 00:08:17.171
Ally?

00:08:19.006 --> 00:08:21.509
San… Sanp…

00:08:22.510 --> 00:08:26.264
You are Sanpee? I'm Alouette.

00:08:29.058 --> 00:08:30.351
Ally!

00:08:30.351 --> 00:08:32.186
I'm okay.

00:08:36.357 --> 00:08:38.359
Sanpee…

00:08:42.947 --> 00:08:45.950
Your tongue is rough. It tickles!

00:08:47.994 --> 00:08:51.747
Nice to meet you, Sanpee. I'm Galina.

00:08:51.747 --> 00:08:57.253
S-Say, could you let us use this car?

00:08:59.046 --> 00:09:01.382
Where’s your owner?

00:09:01.382 --> 00:09:03.718
Who’s the owner of this car?

00:09:06.095 --> 00:09:10.892
This is your owner’s car?
I see, he’s gone, huh?

00:09:10.892 --> 00:09:13.686
So Sanpee’s protecting the car.

00:09:14.729 --> 00:09:18.733
He says that since he admires
Hachiko, he’s imitating him.

00:09:18.733 --> 00:09:21.944
Hachiko? I wonder who that is.

00:09:23.112 --> 00:09:27.658
Uhm… Sanpee, we want
to flee as soon as possible.

00:09:27.658 --> 00:09:30.369
Could we use this car?

00:09:32.079 --> 00:09:36.167
If we don’t get out of here soon,
Yatter soldiers Will…

00:09:36.167 --> 00:09:39.086
No… That’s not it!

00:09:39.086 --> 00:09:42.048
I have to rescue my friends!

00:09:43.090 --> 00:09:49.889
Doronjo… Mr. Boyacky…
Mr. Tonzra… and Honorable Oda!

00:09:49.889 --> 00:09:52.183
I have to go rescue them!

00:09:52.183 --> 00:09:53.851
Sanpee…

00:09:53.851 --> 00:09:56.437
I wanna rescue my friends,
who mean a lot to me!

00:09:56.437 --> 00:09:59.273
Let me use the car! Please!

00:10:05.029 --> 00:10:07.323
He says you can, if it’s for your friends.

00:10:07.323 --> 00:10:09.867
Really? Thank you!

00:10:12.036 --> 00:10:20.670
I see. So, your friend will be happy
if it can run again too, huh, Sanpee?

00:10:22.380 --> 00:10:24.799
The plug is broken…

00:10:24.799 --> 00:10:27.969
I need to replace it and change the oil.

00:10:27.969 --> 00:10:30.554
The fan belt… looks okay.

00:10:30.554 --> 00:10:32.807
Good! Looks like it will still run.

00:10:32.807 --> 00:10:34.100
You can tell?

00:10:34.100 --> 00:10:38.813
Yep. Mr. Boyacky taught
me a lot of things, so…

00:10:41.899 --> 00:10:43.567
All right!

00:10:43.567 --> 00:10:45.444
It should work now.

00:10:47.279 --> 00:10:50.157
How do I start the engine?

00:10:51.158 --> 00:10:52.702
ls this it?

00:10:56.622 --> 00:10:59.041
Let’s see… This one?

00:11:01.544 --> 00:11:03.504
Hello, this is the Kobayashi residence.

00:11:03.504 --> 00:11:05.631
S-Sorry, wrong number!

00:11:07.341 --> 00:11:09.510
What should I do?

00:11:11.637 --> 00:11:13.097
This isn’t good.

00:11:15.850 --> 00:11:17.810
Hey, you’ve got the key!

00:11:21.355 --> 00:11:22.982
Come on…

00:11:33.034 --> 00:11:35.995
Come on! I want to…

00:11:35.995 --> 00:11:37.913
…rescue everyone!

00:12:03.314 --> 00:12:06.859
I see, artificial intelligence, huh…

00:12:06.859 --> 00:12:12.990
Yatter! Yatter! Yatter! Yatter! Yatter!

00:12:12.990 --> 00:12:15.076
Yatter! Yatter! Yatter! Yatter! Yatter!

00:12:15.076 --> 00:12:17.244
What do I do?

00:12:17.244 --> 00:12:21.165
Sanpee, this is no time to be eating a banana!

00:12:21.165 --> 00:12:24.543
Ya ter! Yatter! Yatter…!

00:12:31.425 --> 00:12:33.010
Good job!

00:12:42.428 --> 00:12:43.888
There they are!

00:12:47.016 --> 00:12:50.352
I have to rescue them before
they’re put in Abareshi Prison.

00:12:51.395 --> 00:12:53.063
What do I do?

00:12:54.189 --> 00:12:56.317
Think…

00:12:56.317 --> 00:12:59.069
You’re not rolling… me?

00:12:59.069 --> 00:13:00.738
Think!

00:13:06.869 --> 00:13:12.166
I’ll tell you about Abareshi Prison,
the place we’re taking you.

00:13:12.166 --> 00:13:14.627
It’s surrounded by thick
concrete and iron boards.

00:13:14.627 --> 00:13:16.879
The ceiling and basement are, too.

00:13:16.879 --> 00:13:20.925
There are three 3-meter thick gates.
Opening them from inside

00:13:20.925 --> 00:13:23.594
is the only way to go in and out.

00:13:23.594 --> 00:13:30.351
There, we’ll punish you severely and
make you work as long as you live!

00:13:30.351 --> 00:13:33.437
You’ll produce energy for Lord Yatterman!

00:13:33.437 --> 00:13:36.607
You should be grateful
for being able to do that!

00:13:36.607 --> 00:13:39.610
Well, if you happen to be able to
blow up the reactor core of the energy,

00:13:39.610 --> 00:13:44.239
you might be able to escape,
but that’s not possible.

00:13:45.199 --> 00:13:48.118
It’s impossible to break through
the many layers of protective walls

00:13:48.118 --> 00:13:51.038
surrounding the reactor core.

00:13:52.122 --> 00:13:54.792
Those who go through
the gate to Abareshi Prison

00:13:54.792 --> 00:13:57.127
should give up any sort of hope!

00:13:58.921 --> 00:14:00.464
All right!

00:14:00.464 --> 00:14:02.758
What’re you doing, Gatchan?

00:14:02.758 --> 00:14:07.137
I put on a mask so that
General Goro won’t recognize us.

00:14:07.137 --> 00:14:09.223
You wear one, too, Alouette.

00:14:09.223 --> 00:14:10.599
Here they come!

00:14:12.810 --> 00:14:15.020
First, I have to hold them up.

00:14:28.659 --> 00:14:31.537
I'm counting on you, GoGoGo!

00:14:31.537 --> 00:14:33.080
Let’s go!

00:14:49.722 --> 00:14:51.473
Hold it!

00:14:51.473 --> 00:14:53.350
Who are you?!

00:14:53.350 --> 00:14:56.228
I'm gonna get Doronjo and the others back!

00:14:56.228 --> 00:14:58.063
What?!

00:14:58.063 --> 00:15:00.524
Don’t stop no matter what!

00:15:06.739 --> 00:15:08.532
This feels good!

00:15:08.532 --> 00:15:10.451
This is no time for that.

00:15:15.205 --> 00:15:16.582
We caught up with them!

00:15:16.582 --> 00:15:18.417
They’re so persistent!

00:15:19.501 --> 00:15:22.796
Yatterelephant Paddy Wagon!
Here’s the Mecha Tonic for you!

00:15:27.217 --> 00:15:30.179
Poop.Poop.Poopu.

00:15:30.179 --> 00:15:31.555
Bombs?!

00:15:32.556 --> 00:15:34.558
0h no! I can’t dodge them!

00:15:47.780 --> 00:15:49.323
Sanpee! Take care of Ally.

00:15:50.491 --> 00:15:53.118
I’ll jump on to Yatterelephant Paddy Wagon.

00:15:53.118 --> 00:15:54.912
Ally! You hang on tight!

00:15:54.912 --> 00:15:56.330
Okay!

00:15:56.330 --> 00:15:59.416
It’ll be fine. I can do it.

00:15:59.416 --> 00:16:01.710
Okay…

00:16:01.710 --> 00:16:03.670
Here we go!

00:16:03.670 --> 00:16:05.380
I won’t let you!

00:16:08.550 --> 00:16:10.761
Dog, you take care of that car!

00:16:13.597 --> 00:16:16.642
Is there something I can use as a weapon?

00:16:18.977 --> 00:16:20.562
This is it for you!

00:16:20.604 --> 00:16:21.271
This is it for you!

00:16:27.277 --> 00:16:28.779
Doggie?

00:16:28.779 --> 00:16:30.489
Aloue--

00:17:09.153 --> 00:17:10.696
Doggie…

00:17:14.700 --> 00:17:16.702
This is it, kid!

00:17:16.702 --> 00:17:18.036
Yatter!

00:17:36.180 --> 00:17:37.514
Guys!

00:17:39.683 --> 00:17:42.519
Evil will have no place in this world!

00:17:47.024 --> 00:17:50.027
Are you okay? I’ll untie you now.

00:17:52.446 --> 00:17:55.115
Gatchan, we have to
hurry up and stop the wagon!

00:17:59.453 --> 00:18:02.289
Yatterelephant Paddy Wagon will arrive shortly.

00:18:02.289 --> 00:18:03.498
Open the gate!

00:18:03.498 --> 00:18:04.458
Yes, sir!

00:18:18.972 --> 00:18:20.432
It won’t stop!

00:18:20.432 --> 00:18:22.017
What?!

00:18:57.052 --> 00:18:57.761
Here goes…!

00:18:57.761 --> 00:18:59.096
--Hey…!
--Hey…!

00:18:59.096 --> 00:19:00.264
Hey!

00:19:03.725 --> 00:19:06.270
I thought we were gonna die!

00:19:06.270 --> 00:19:09.606
I almost became roast park, oink.

00:19:22.828 --> 00:19:25.080
Thank you, Sanpee!

00:19:26.957 --> 00:19:32.379
Sanpee says that his friend is happy,
too, since it could run again.

00:19:32.379 --> 00:19:33.839
I see.

00:19:36.383 --> 00:19:39.344
We’re completely indebted to
Gatchan for rescuing us this time.

00:19:39.344 --> 00:19:43.682
Yeah. He’s quite something.

00:19:43.682 --> 00:19:45.434
He is.

00:19:46.476 --> 00:19:48.770
What’re you going to do now?

00:19:50.397 --> 00:19:52.607
Going for a drive?

00:19:52.607 --> 00:19:57.529
Together with his friend… forever.

00:19:57.529 --> 00:19:59.448
Let’s go!

00:20:09.166 --> 00:20:11.710
Now, we should get going, too!

00:20:15.380 --> 00:20:17.424
Y-Yeah.

00:20:30.187 --> 00:20:33.106
How sad, Goro.

00:20:33.106 --> 00:20:36.234
You’re a disgrace to the
Twelve Yatter Guardian Gods.

00:20:36.234 --> 00:20:38.445
Too pitiful.

00:20:56.004 --> 00:20:57.714
A skylark…

00:21:01.843 --> 00:21:05.639
What’s happening… to me?

00:21:08.141 --> 00:21:13.230
Yo-ho… Yo-ho… Yo-ho… Yo-ho… Yo-ho…

00:21:13.230 --> 00:21:17.150
You know… I heard Doggie’s voice.

00:21:17.150 --> 00:21:18.944
What?

00:21:18.944 --> 00:21:23.323
I’ll be able to see my mom and dad soon.

00:21:25.700 --> 00:21:28.328
Hello, Miss Skylark.

00:21:31.248 --> 00:21:34.000
Spring is just around the corner.

00:21:41.174 --> 00:21:46.596
Yo-ho… Yo-ho… Yo-ho… Yo-ho…

00:21:46.596 --> 00:21:48.014
Could it be…?

00:21:48.014 --> 00:21:50.100
Is it possibly…?

00:21:50.100 --> 00:21:52.936
It’s possible, oink.

00:21:52.936 --> 00:21:54.479
Doronjo!

00:21:56.231 --> 00:21:57.607
Right!

00:22:10.900 --> 00:22:17.990
Should I raise my RPM and dream?

00:22:20.200 --> 00:22:25.620
Don't put it off for tomorrow, do it now

00:22:25.620 --> 00:22:27.920
My strong heart wants to get started

00:22:27.920 --> 00:22:30.000
I want to see change, so let's go

00:22:29.880 --> 00:22:35.550
I'm running too fast to smell the roses

00:22:35.340 --> 00:22:37.590
My strong heart's at max speed

00:22:37.590 --> 00:22:40.180
I made a wish because I wanted a change

00:22:40.180 --> 00:22:44.140
I search, I tire, I fall, and I get back up

00:22:44.140 --> 00:22:50.770
I'll enjoy this every time

00:22:51.480 --> 00:22:53.440
Continue your passion

00:22:53.440 --> 00:22:55.900
Continue your passion

00:22:55.900 --> 00:22:57.190
I'll support you

00:22:57.190 --> 00:22:58.150
I'm on your side

00:22:58.150 --> 00:22:59.410
Jump, jump, pushing the limits is my life story

00:22:59.410 --> 00:23:01.200
Jump, jump, pushing the limits is my life story

00:23:01.200 --> 00:23:05.660
My drive ain't no work of fiction

00:23:05.660 --> 00:23:06.870
I want to see you

00:23:06.870 --> 00:23:07.910
Today, if I can

00:23:07.910 --> 00:23:09.670
After all, my fingers just won't stop

00:23:09.670 --> 00:23:11.040
After all, my fingers just won't stop

00:23:11.040 --> 00:23:15.130
Don't you know?

00:23:12.880 --> 00:23:16.460
Day and night, I'm missing you

00:23:16.090 --> 00:23:17.800
The world might get you down,

00:23:17.630 --> 00:23:17.800
Nothing in the world is going your way

00:23:17.800 --> 00:23:19.720
The world might get you down,

00:23:17.800 --> 00:23:20.180
Nothing in the world is going your way

00:23:20.180 --> 00:23:22.930
But continue your passions

